      <title>为 2023 Subaru Outback 安装 Subaru D harness</title>
      <link>https://blog.sparktour.me/posts/2026/08/31/subaru-outback-comma-openpilot-harness-install/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
